  "comment_hazards": "Layout per the user's reference (toy BattleBox + floor photo): two pulverizers on pedestals in opposite corners (the real box has four), one twin-auger screw mid-wall on EVERY wall, six floor killsaws that rotate in random sets of three every 5 s for the last minute (real box: proximity). All data - add corners, change activeCount, or set deploy to \"proximity\".",
  "killsaw": {
    "_comment": "Defaults for every hazard of type killsaw. deploy:\"rotating\" (default) brings up `activeCount` randomly chosen saws from deployAtRemainingS, and swaps in a fresh random set every `rotateEveryS`; \"timed\" brings them ALL up and leaves them up; \"proximity\" is the real-arena behaviour (up only when a bot is close).",
    "deploy": "rotating",
    "deployAtRemainingS": 60,
    "rotateEveryS": 5,
    "activeCount": 3,
